Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.86,0:19:05.11,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\frz251.1\pos(1638,306)\fad(100,0)\c&HB5412B&}恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.61,0:19:05.11,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\c&HB5412B&\frz290.5\pos(477,351)}好強
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.36,0:19:05.11,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)\c&HB5412B&\frz313.1\pos(162,843)}糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:16.39,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\frz257.5\fad(130,0)\pos(969,519)}果然
